        "subject": "LU-21225 tests: conf-sanity 134 needs check_iam from 2.16.51",
        "message": "LU-21225 tests: conf-sanity 134 needs check_iam from 2.16.51\n\nconf-sanity test_134 also checks the LFSCK and nodemap IAM files on\nservers at 2.16.0 or later. check_iam only supports those files since\nLU-18401, which landed in 2.16.51 and is not in b2_16. With b2_16\nservers check_iam reports errors on the uncorrupted files and the\nerror count never matches the corrupted count.\n\nCheck for MDS version 2.16.51 instead of 2.16.0 before adding these\nfiles.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=134 serverversion=2.16\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=134\nFixes: 7b21e7738e (\"LU-18401 utils: check_iam, support more iam records types\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: If1f300581052460a2f7d7533287bbaa51d31384f\n"
      },
